# Runtime artifacts created by `bun install` / OpenCode runtime.
#
# IMPORTANT for future contributors (human and LLM): if you need to
# install JS dependencies for OpenCode plugins or run `bun install`,
# do it in the DEPLOYED config directory (`~/.config/opencode/`),
# NOT inside this stow source dir (`opencode/.config/opencode/`).
#
# The dotfiles repo is the stow SOURCE; `~/.config/opencode/` is
# where OpenCode actually runs. Installing deps in the source dir
# creates duplicate copies that bloat the public repo and confuse
# `stow` (which walks the source tree on disk). Anything matched
# below is therefore allowed to exist locally for convenience but
# must never be committed.
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
bun.lock

# Local secrets directory — never commit.
secrets/
